Gyro TQ trellis tensor formats: specification and reference implementation
Copyright 2026 AgentionAI (Laurent Zuijdwijk)

This product includes the Gyro format specification and reference code developed by
AgentionAI (https://gitlab.com/agentionai-group/agention-gyro).

The Gyro format builds on trellis-coded quantization with incoherence processing as
described in QTIP (Tseng et al., 2024, "QTIP: Quantization with Trellises and Incoherence
Processing").

The normative codebook is included with its declaration reformatted.
The codebook binary16 values are unchanged. Runtime format decoders follow the
reference bitstream and codebook specification.
